WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.933 --> 00:00:06.933
On their way to Shalour City for Ash’s next Gym battle,

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.600
our heroes met Gym Leader Korrina and her partner, Lucario.

3
00:00:10.666 --> 00:00:14.933
Korrina agreed to let our heroes accompany her to Geosenge Town

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.300
to witness Lucario’s Mega Evolution.

5
00:00:17.366 --> 00:00:22.433
Now, they’ve arrived in town to search for the Mega Stone known as Lucarionite.

6
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.466
- So that’s Geosenge Town.
- Pika!

7
00:00:26.533 --> 00:00:29.500
- We’re here, Dedenne!
- Na!

8
00:00:29.566 --> 00:00:30.900
What a cute town!

9
00:00:30.966 --> 00:00:34.433
So we’re supposed to find the Mega Stone here, right?

10
00:00:35.533 --> 00:00:37.533
- Korrina?
- Finally...

11
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:38.933
What’s wrong?

12
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.433
- Are you all right?
- Finally, I’m here.

13
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.433
- Yeah!
- Whoa! Oh, wow!

14
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:48.233
Yup! We did it! We’re in Geosenge Town, Lucario!

15
00:00:49.533 --> 00:00:51.533
We won 100 battles in a row!

16
00:00:51.599 --> 00:00:54.900
Now it’s time! Time for you to Mega Evolve!

17
00:00:54.966 --> 00:00:57.166
Okay, let’s go!

18
00:00:57.233 --> 00:01:00.099
- Hey! Hold on, Korrina!
- Pika!

19
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.866
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

20
00:01:05.933 --> 00:01:09.700
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

21
00:01:09.766 --> 00:01:12.100
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

22
00:01:12.166 --> 00:01:15.233
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

23
00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:18.366
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

24
00:01:18.433 --> 00:01:21.200
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

25
00:01:21.266 --> 00:01:24.933
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

26
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.466
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

27
00:01:27.533 --> 00:01:29.866
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

28
00:01:29.933 --> 00:01:32.933
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

29
00:01:43.766 --> 00:01:46.433
Korrina, I know you’re here for Lucarionite,

30
00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:49.633
- but do you know where to find it?
- Not a clue!

31
00:01:49.699 --> 00:01:53.199
But if you don’t know where it is, how are you going to look for it?

32
00:01:53.266 --> 00:01:57.666
Grandfather told me that if we came to Geosenge Town, we’d figure it out

33
00:01:57.733 --> 00:01:59.800
and my grandfather’s really smart!

34
00:01:59.866 --> 00:02:01.533
Figure it out?!

35
00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:05.266
I guess Ash and Korrina are the types who like to just jump into things.

36
00:02:05.333 --> 00:02:08.433
That’s why you two get along.

37
00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:10.933
Oh! Look at all these beautiful stones!

38
00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:14.566
I guess lots of stores here sell Evolution stones.

39
00:02:14.633 --> 00:02:16.933
I want one! I want one!

40
00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:20.666
I just got me a Sun Stone!

41
00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:23.400
Come out, Helioptile!

42
00:02:25.233 --> 00:02:27.466
- Evolve!
- Heli!

43
00:02:30.933 --> 00:02:32.966
- Heliolisk!
- All right!

44
00:02:33.033 --> 00:02:35.933
- Helioptile evolved!
- Awesome!

45
00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:38.700
Hey, Clemont, how did your Helioptile evolve?

46
00:02:38.766 --> 00:02:42.433
I evolved Helioptile into Heliolisk with a Sun Stone as well.

47
00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:45.466
Oh, yeah, Ash, I was wondering, isn’t Pikachu going to evolve?

48
00:02:45.533 --> 00:02:48.799
Evolve? You see, Pikachu doesn’t actually want to evolve.

49
00:02:48.866 --> 00:02:49.866
- Right?
- Pika!

50
00:02:49.933 --> 00:02:51.733
Wow. Okay.

51
00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:57.233
Now, let’s hurry and find that Lucarionite super quick!

52
00:02:57.299 --> 00:03:00.733
I suggest we all split up and search every store in town.

53
00:03:00.799 --> 00:03:01.799
Right!

54
00:03:01.866 --> 00:03:05.266
- Sorry, but I’m afraid not.
- Are you serious?

55
00:03:05.333 --> 00:03:09.000
- Nah! Never heard of it!
- Really?

56
00:03:09.066 --> 00:03:12.500
No. I’m very sorry.

57
00:03:12.566 --> 00:03:15.566
Perhaps one of these might interest you instead.

58
00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:19.933
Hey, Clemont, did you have any luck?

59
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:23.666
I’m afraid not. Every single shop owner I spoke to said

60
00:03:23.733 --> 00:03:25.799
they had never even heard of Lucarionite.

61
00:03:25.866 --> 00:03:27.866
Hold on! My grandfather told me

62
00:03:27.933 --> 00:03:30.866
that we’d find the Lucarionite right here, in this town!

63
00:03:30.933 --> 00:03:35.133
Well, I suppose that unless Lucarionite was very difficult to find,

64
00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:38.233
we would have heard about the Mega Evolution of lots of Lucario.

65
00:03:38.299 --> 00:03:40.500
- Oh!
- So that means...?

66
00:03:40.566 --> 00:03:44.766
I’d say it must be a very rare stone. It seems awfully hard to find.

67
00:03:44.833 --> 00:03:48.200
- So, then, how do we continue our search?
- Hm.

68
00:03:48.266 --> 00:03:50.733
Now I remember what Grandfather told me.

69
00:03:52.133 --> 00:03:57.200
Now, listen, Korrina. When the time comes, you’ll understand what you need

70
00:03:57.266 --> 00:04:01.333
and then you’ll both be ready for Lucario’s Mega Evolution.

71
00:04:01.399 --> 00:04:02.633
Hm.

72
00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:07.200
It’s not going to be easy, that’s part of your training, too.

73
00:04:07.266 --> 00:04:11.966
That’s right. We can’t lose heart now! What’s right for me,

74
00:04:12.033 --> 00:04:16.033
finding it by ourselves will make Mega Evolution possible!

75
00:04:16.099 --> 00:04:18.633
- That’s the spirit!
- Sure is.

76
00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:21.000
- Too early to give up!
- Pikachu!

77
00:04:21.066 --> 00:04:24.000
But we’ve still got to figure out what we’re going to do.

78
00:04:24.066 --> 00:04:25.333
Pika...

79
00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:27.033
- Excuse me, young lady!
- Huh?

80
00:04:27.099 --> 00:04:30.200
The name’s McGinty. I’m a photographer.

81
00:04:30.266 --> 00:04:33.566
How about I take a picture of you all as a souvenir photo?

82
00:04:33.633 --> 00:04:36.733
It’s what I do and I know you’ll be very happy with it.

83
00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:40.266
- Souvenir photo? Oh, boy!
- Na! Na!

84
00:04:40.333 --> 00:04:43.166
That’s a great idea. Since we’re all here together,

85
00:04:43.233 --> 00:04:45.533
then we’ll have a nice picture as a memento.

86
00:04:45.599 --> 00:04:48.733
- You think so?
- Let’s go for it and take a group photo.

87
00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:50.466
- Why not?
- Pika!

88
00:04:50.533 --> 00:04:53.000
All right! We’re in Geosenge Town!

89
00:04:53.066 --> 00:04:56.433
I want to show Grandfather that we made it all the way!

90
00:04:56.500 --> 00:05:01.233
- Okay, line up over there!
- Okay!

91
00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.733
Now, squeeze in just a little more.

92
00:05:06.233 --> 00:05:08.933
Hey, come on, Clemont, don’t you know how to smile?

93
00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.466
I am smiling.

94
00:05:10.533 --> 00:05:15.599
Okay, give me some big smiles, everyone!

95
00:05:15.666 --> 00:05:19.666
I got it! Now, we’ll print this up right away.

96
00:05:19.733 --> 00:05:22.033
- Please, make it quick, okay?
- Uh-huh!

97
00:05:23.599 --> 00:05:27.466
Do you by any chance know anything about locating Evolution stones?

98
00:05:27.533 --> 00:05:33.200
Evolution stones are out there, in a cave that’s hidden inside of that mountain.

99
00:05:33.266 --> 00:05:35.233
Wow, a mountain cave?

100
00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:38.233
And sir, do you know anything about Lucarionite?

101
00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:41.633
- I need to find it right away!
- Lucarionite, eh?

102
00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:44.466
I don't think I’ve never heard of that before.

103
00:05:44.533 --> 00:05:46.200
Oh! Thank you.

104
00:05:46.266 --> 00:05:49.099
Although I do remember hearing about a cave

105
00:05:49.166 --> 00:05:52.700
where it’s possible to locate a special kind of evolution stone.

106
00:05:52.766 --> 00:05:54.233
- Huh?
- You mean it?

107
00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:56.200
- Please tell us where it is!
- Where, where, where?

108
00:05:56.266 --> 00:06:01.033
If you go even farther into the mountain than the cave I already told you about,

109
00:06:01.099 --> 00:06:03.800
you’ll find a small entrance to another cave.

110
00:06:03.866 --> 00:06:05.266
That’s where it is.

111
00:06:05.333 --> 00:06:07.800
That might be just what we’re looking for!

112
00:06:07.866 --> 00:06:11.266
- Maybe. Let’s check it out, Korrina!
- Uh-huh!

113
00:06:11.333 --> 00:06:15.033
You know, it’s said that terrible things can happen to people

114
00:06:15.099 --> 00:06:17.266
who are not worthy enough to enter.

115
00:06:17.333 --> 00:06:20.266
- Terrible things?
- Or an adventure!

116
00:06:20.333 --> 00:06:23.099
I can’t tell you for sure, but there’s some evidence

117
00:06:23.166 --> 00:06:25.466
that terrible things really do happen there

118
00:06:25.533 --> 00:06:29.266
and that’s why the people from this town never ever venture into that cave!

119
00:06:29.333 --> 00:06:32.466
- Oh!
- I think you must be wrong.

120
00:06:32.533 --> 00:06:35.299
It can't be a cave that as scary as all that.

121
00:06:35.366 --> 00:06:37.666
You're wrong! I know this is it.

122
00:06:37.733 --> 00:06:41.833
Just you wait, Lucarionite! I’m going to find you in a flash!

123
00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:44.433
Come on, let’s go!

124
00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:47.766
But wait! You forgot your photo’s not quite ready yet!

125
00:06:47.833 --> 00:06:50.433
Oh. Guess you’re right.

126
00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:52.466
Well, isn’t that interesting.

127
00:06:52.533 --> 00:06:56.866
If we can get to that cave first, we’ll be able to lay claim to the Mega Stone first!

128
00:06:56.933 --> 00:06:59.299
And pinch Pikachu in the process!

129
00:06:59.366 --> 00:07:02.066
Another rung on the ladder to success!

130
00:07:02.133 --> 00:07:04.700
And we’ll be praised by the Boss, no less!

131
00:07:04.766 --> 00:07:06.366
Wobbuffet!

132
00:07:06.433 --> 00:07:09.266
Here! Your picture’s all done!

133
00:07:09.333 --> 00:07:11.633
Wow! It looks awesome!

134
00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:13.866
- Thanks a lot!
- Pikachu.

135
00:07:13.933 --> 00:07:15.833
Thanks! What a great souvenir!

136
00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:17.466
I can keep it forever!

137
00:07:17.533 --> 00:07:20.900
Yup! I can’t wait to show it to my grandfather!

138
00:07:20.966 --> 00:07:24.833
Don’t you think he’ll just love it?

139
00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:27.366
Mm.

140
00:07:27.433 --> 00:07:31.666
- Serena, we’re going!
- Huh? Right!

141
00:07:36.666 --> 00:07:40.433
It worked out just as we planned, didn't it, Gurkinn?

142
00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:44.433
Okay! Bring them a little more to the center!

143
00:07:47.033 --> 00:07:48.433
How’s that?

144
00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:51.500
It’s perfect! Those clueless twerps will never know

145
00:07:51.566 --> 00:07:55.333
- there’s a cave lurking back there!
- Now they’ll do what they always do.

146
00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:56.933
They’ll take the wrong way, of course.

147
00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:01.700
And while they run around like wackos, we’ll be in the cave. Mega Stone, ho!

148
00:08:01.766 --> 00:08:06.233
And when they finally do show up, we’ll swoop down on them like Flying types!

149
00:08:07.766 --> 00:08:11.099
Catching Pikachu will finally be on our résumé!

150
00:08:11.166 --> 00:08:13.133
- Yay!
- Wobbuffet!

151
00:08:16.033 --> 00:08:18.799
So this is where they mine Evolution stones!

152
00:08:18.866 --> 00:08:21.166
I can’t wait to get a closer look!

153
00:08:21.233 --> 00:08:24.000
We’d better concentrate on Lucarionite, first.

154
00:08:24.066 --> 00:08:26.533
Yes, you’re right. Didn’t Mr. McGinty say

155
00:08:26.599 --> 00:08:29.433
there was a cave located even further back?

156
00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:33.000
Further back. Right! Come on, let’s go!

157
00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:38.533
- Slow down, Korrina!
- Pika, Pika!

158
00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:48.866
Oh, please! There’s nothing scary in here.

159
00:08:48.933 --> 00:08:54.000
What a silly thing to say. Terrible things can happen to people who aren't worthy.

160
00:08:54.066 --> 00:08:55.366
- Dumb!
- A real duh!

161
00:08:55.433 --> 00:08:59.100
I can guarantee that Lucarionite is just waiting quietly

162
00:08:59.166 --> 00:09:01.833
to be found and cared for by Team Rocket.

163
00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:03.766
- Wobb!
- What, Wobbuffet?

164
00:09:03.833 --> 00:09:06.000
Wobb, Wobb!

165
00:09:06.066 --> 00:09:09.566
Hey! It looks like some sort of a doorway!

166
00:09:09.633 --> 00:09:13.466
- And it’s begging for us to open it.
- So let’s.

167
00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:21.400
Who’s that Pokémon?

168
00:09:26.066 --> 00:09:28.166
It’s Blaziken!

169
00:09:32.833 --> 00:09:36.500
Hm. That was a dead end. Wonder if we went the wrong way.

170
00:09:36.566 --> 00:09:39.766
I thought we were just supposed to go straight ahead.

171
00:09:39.833 --> 00:09:43.033
It’s possible we may have missed a turn or something.

172
00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:47.566
I want to find that cave! I want to find that Lucarionite right now!

173
00:09:48.666 --> 00:09:50.066
Huh?

174
00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:56.666
- What is it, Lucario?
- What’s up?

175
00:09:56.733 --> 00:09:57.933
Pika?

176
00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:05.033
- Look at that!
- There’s a pathway in there!

177
00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:07.266
It’s no wonder we didn’t see it!

178
00:10:07.333 --> 00:10:09.433
Maybe someone hid it on purpose!

179
00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:13.600
Whatever! I say the thing that really counts is Lucario found it!

180
00:10:13.666 --> 00:10:16.100
Yup. Great, Lucario!

181
00:10:21.933 --> 00:10:25.600
-Feel something?

182
00:10:25.666 --> 00:10:28.266
I wonder what Lucario’s sensing this time.

183
00:10:28.333 --> 00:10:30.633
- Danger, maybe?
- Hard to say.

184
00:10:30.699 --> 00:10:32.833
- Lucario?
- Huh?

185
00:10:37.733 --> 00:10:40.199
- Look, it’s a cave!
- We found it!

186
00:10:40.266 --> 00:10:43.166
Lucario, you’re amazing! How did you know?

187
00:10:43.233 --> 00:10:46.733
-Lucario must’ve sensed the Lucarionite.

188
00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:50.166
I’ve got it! It’s got to be somewhere inside this cave!

189
00:10:50.233 --> 00:10:52.300
- Huh?
- Like Grandfather said.

190
00:10:52.366 --> 00:10:57.166
He told me Lucario and I would find the Lucarionite together. That’s it, right?

191
00:10:57.233 --> 00:10:59.066
- Amazing.
- Pika!

192
00:10:59.133 --> 00:11:03.300
Yes. But we won’t know for sure unless we go in and find out, right?

193
00:11:03.366 --> 00:11:05.466
- Okay, let’s go!
- Yeah!

194
00:11:08.266 --> 00:11:10.800
But it’s pitch black in there.

195
00:11:10.866 --> 00:11:14.366
In that case, I say Clemontic Gear on!

196
00:11:15.866 --> 00:11:17.366
Way to go, Clemont!

197
00:11:19.866 --> 00:11:23.966
- Uh-oh! What was that sound?
- What’s in there?

198
00:11:24.033 --> 00:11:25.766
- A ghost?
- Don’t be silly!

199
00:11:25.833 --> 00:11:28.600
Why does this happen to me?!

200
00:11:28.666 --> 00:11:31.133
Or me?

201
00:11:31.199 --> 00:11:35.933
- We’re blasting off again!
- Wobbuffet!

202
00:11:38.366 --> 00:11:41.500
- Was that...
- Team Rocket?

203
00:11:41.566 --> 00:11:44.699
- Pika!
- They must’ve snuck in ahead of us!

204
00:11:44.766 --> 00:11:47.233
- They’re so sneaky!
- Na!

205
00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:49.233
Oh! The Lucarionite!

206
00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:51.766
-Huh? Lucario?

207
00:11:51.833 --> 00:11:54.233
I think there’s something back there.

208
00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:57.433
So what? We can’t just run away!

209
00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:00.600
We’ve got to get the Lucarionite now!

210
00:12:00.666 --> 00:12:02.666
We’re right behind you, Korrina.

211
00:12:02.733 --> 00:12:05.633
- It could be dangerous. Keep close!
- Uh-huh!

212
00:12:05.699 --> 00:12:09.300
- Oh! Protect us, okay, Pikachu?
- Pika!

213
00:12:10.833 --> 00:12:14.833
Something’s growling back there.

214
00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:18.400
- I'm sure it’s just the wind!
- Huh?

215
00:12:18.466 --> 00:12:20.733
What’s that?

216
00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:23.733
-Hm.

217
00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:41.133
Lucarionite!

218
00:12:41.199 --> 00:12:43.199
- Check it out!
- Pika!

219
00:12:43.266 --> 00:12:46.166
- Is it really?
- It’s beautiful!

220
00:12:46.233 --> 00:12:47.266
I knew it!

221
00:12:47.333 --> 00:12:50.366
It’s like the Lucarionite was calling out to Lucario!

222
00:12:51.699 --> 00:12:54.566
Great! Now Lucario will be able to Mega Evolve!

223
00:12:54.633 --> 00:12:57.466
Let’s go, quick!

224
00:12:57.533 --> 00:13:00.500
Blaziken!

225
00:13:00.566 --> 00:13:05.466
- What’s that?!
- Blaze! Blaze!

226
00:13:06.599 --> 00:13:08.566
Are you okay, Lucario?

227
00:13:08.633 --> 00:13:10.833
- What was all that?
- Hold on!

228
00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:14.833
Blaziken, the Blaze Pokémon.

229
00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:18.800
Blaziken leaves its opponents charred with its fiery punches.

230
00:13:18.866 --> 00:13:21.333
What’s a Blaziken doing here?

231
00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:23.800
Maybe Blaziken threw Team Rocket out of the cave!

232
00:13:23.866 --> 00:13:27.300
- Help! I’m scared!
- Is it mad?

233
00:13:32.366 --> 00:13:35.133
I see! If we want the Lucarionite,

234
00:13:35.199 --> 00:13:39.300
first we're going to have to defeat Blaziken in a Pokémon battle!

235
00:13:39.366 --> 00:13:41.099
Hm!

236
00:13:41.166 --> 00:13:43.466
I think you should stand back.

237
00:13:43.533 --> 00:13:47.099
This is the last hurdle before Lucario can Mega Evolve.

238
00:13:47.166 --> 00:13:51.266
- I hear you. Good luck, Korrina.
- Pika, Pika!

239
00:13:51.333 --> 00:13:54.833
Thanks, but there’s no way we’re going to lose now!

240
00:13:57.733 --> 00:14:00.266
Hello, Blaziken! My name’s Korrina.

241
00:14:00.333 --> 00:14:04.833
I challenge you for the Lucarionite, so Lucario can Mega Evolve!

242
00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:08.733
Battle begin! Lucario, Power-Up Punch!

243
00:14:11.066 --> 00:14:13.800
- Yeah!
- There’s their first attack!

244
00:14:15.966 --> 00:14:18.599
Blaziken!

245
00:14:18.666 --> 00:14:20.966
Lucario!

246
00:14:21.033 --> 00:14:22.933
-Lucario, dodge it!

247
00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:27.166
Blaze! Blaze! Blaziken! Blaziken!

248
00:14:27.233 --> 00:14:30.166
- Lucario!
- Blaziken moves so fast!

249
00:14:30.233 --> 00:14:32.166
It sure is one tough opponent!

250
00:14:32.233 --> 00:14:33.599
Use Metal Sound!

251
00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:43.933
Blaziken!

252
00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:46.166
- Yes! Awesome!
- Pikachu!

253
00:14:46.233 --> 00:14:47.500
Watch out...

254
00:14:49.033 --> 00:14:50.466
Blaze!

255
00:14:50.533 --> 00:14:52.000
Lucario!

256
00:14:53.366 --> 00:14:55.533
- What a Flamethrower!
- Pika!

257
00:14:55.599 --> 00:14:59.766
I know. Blaziken’s a Fire and Fighting type. It’s not a good matchup!

258
00:14:59.833 --> 00:15:03.266
And along with Blaziken’s speed... so strong!

259
00:15:03.333 --> 00:15:05.033
You're right!

260
00:15:05.099 --> 00:15:07.599
- Lucario!
- Blaze!

261
00:15:27.699 --> 00:15:28.833
Oh!

262
00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:32.633
Oh, no! I can’t watch! We have to stop this!

263
00:15:32.699 --> 00:15:35.000
- We can’t!
- Why not?

264
00:15:35.066 --> 00:15:39.166
Korrina said this was her battle! We’ve got to stay out of it!

265
00:15:40.199 --> 00:15:44.300
Isn’t that true? You won’t give up, right?

266
00:15:44.366 --> 00:15:49.033
Ash gets it. He totally understands.

267
00:15:49.099 --> 00:15:52.333
That’s right! We’ll never give up!

268
00:15:52.400 --> 00:15:55.166
No matter who we’re up against in battle,

269
00:15:55.233 --> 00:15:59.733
we’ll never turn and run the other way! Right, Lucario?

270
00:16:01.433 --> 00:16:04.333
- Please! Get up!
- You can do it!

271
00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:08.500
- Lucario!
- Yeah. Get up! Come on!

272
00:16:08.566 --> 00:16:10.533
Pika! Pika!

273
00:16:14.933 --> 00:16:17.199
Blaze!

274
00:16:17.266 --> 00:16:18.733
-All right!

275
00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:21.233
Lucario, Power-Up Punch, go!

276
00:16:34.133 --> 00:16:36.433
All right! Way to go!

277
00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:38.333
Blaze!

278
00:16:41.966 --> 00:16:43.233
-Awesome!

279
00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:46.533
Blaziken can’t move, so speed won’t help it now!

280
00:16:46.599 --> 00:16:49.900
We’re almost done. Lucario, let’s finish this up!

281
00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:53.333
Enough!

282
00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:54.833
Huh?

283
00:16:58.333 --> 00:16:59.833
You have won.

284
00:17:01.833 --> 00:17:03.633
- Hi, Korrina.
- Grandfather!

285
00:17:03.699 --> 00:17:05.233
That’s your grandfather?

286
00:17:05.300 --> 00:17:09.733
Yes. They call me the Mega Evolution guru. I’m Gurkinn.

287
00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:12.333
- Mega Evolution guru?
- Pika?

288
00:17:12.399 --> 00:17:14.866
And he’s Korrina’s grandfather, as well?

289
00:17:14.933 --> 00:17:17.233
So what is he doing here anyway?

290
00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:20.333
You battled nobly, Blaziken. You may return.

291
00:17:20.399 --> 00:17:25.466
What’s going on? Does all of this mean Blaziken is your Pokémon, Grandfather?

292
00:17:25.533 --> 00:17:28.066
- That’s right.
- But why all of this?

293
00:17:28.133 --> 00:17:31.833
I knew that you would complete your training and make it here successfully.

294
00:17:31.899 --> 00:17:34.833
So I thought I’d give you this final trial myself

295
00:17:34.899 --> 00:17:38.399
and you overcame it beautifully, as I knew you would.

296
00:17:38.466 --> 00:17:41.333
You passed this final test with flying colors!

297
00:17:41.399 --> 00:17:46.333
Well done, Korrina, dear. And, you as well, Lucario.

298
00:17:46.399 --> 00:17:48.700
Grandfather!

299
00:17:48.766 --> 00:17:52.833
Now, go forth and take what you’ve earned!

300
00:18:06.800 --> 00:18:09.833
We’ve finally got the Lucarionite!

301
00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:20.700
- Mr. McGinty!
- Huh?

302
00:18:20.766 --> 00:18:23.600
- Pika!
- We came back!

303
00:18:23.666 --> 00:18:28.333
Well, it’s nice to see you. Did you find what you were looking for?

304
00:18:28.399 --> 00:18:31.600
- Yup! We sure did.
- Wonderful!

305
00:18:31.666 --> 00:18:35.100
Sorry, Mr. McGinty. You took such a nice photo of us,

306
00:18:35.166 --> 00:18:37.466
but I’m afraid mine got burned up.

307
00:18:37.533 --> 00:18:41.633
I see. Well then, we’ll just have to print you out another one.

308
00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:44.166
Really? Thanks a lot!

309
00:18:44.233 --> 00:18:46.233
Say! It looks like it went well.

310
00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:49.133
Your granddaughter really is something special.

311
00:18:49.200 --> 00:18:52.600
She’s my granddaughter! Of course she is!

312
00:18:52.666 --> 00:18:54.033
Huh?

313
00:18:54.100 --> 00:18:55.966
Wait. Do you know Korrina’s grandfather?

314
00:18:56.033 --> 00:19:01.766
Actually, he asked me to help you out in your quest to locate the Lucarionite.

315
00:19:01.833 --> 00:19:03.233
That’s right.

316
00:19:03.300 --> 00:19:06.233
- So you knew from the beginning?!
- Pika, Pika?

317
00:19:06.300 --> 00:19:08.300
Sorry, kids.

318
00:19:08.366 --> 00:19:12.899
Then what’s up with that story about something terrible happening in the cave?

319
00:19:12.966 --> 00:19:15.433
- I made it up.
- Made it up?

320
00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:16.733
-Pika.

321
00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:20.300
If someone unworthy of the Mega Stone had gone inside the cave,

322
00:19:20.366 --> 00:19:24.233
Blaziken would have driven them off, so it wasn’t a total lie.

323
00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:26.399
Oh, like Team Rocket!

324
00:19:26.466 --> 00:19:28.233
-Pika.

325
00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:30.766
- Now, Korrina.
- Yeah?

326
00:19:30.833 --> 00:19:35.233
As proof that you overcame your trial, the Lucarionite is yours.

327
00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:38.000
- I’m giving it to you!
- Thanks!

328
00:19:38.066 --> 00:19:41.066
- Good for you! Lucario, too.
- Pika! Pika!

329
00:19:41.133 --> 00:19:42.800
- Wonderful!
- It sure is!

330
00:19:42.866 --> 00:19:44.533
Congratulations!

331
00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:48.300
You’re so nice. Thank you!

332
00:19:49.300 --> 00:19:52.433
Okay, Korrina. Are you ready?

333
00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:54.500
Ready, Grandfather!

334
00:20:01.233 --> 00:20:04.200
Here we go, Lucario!

335
00:20:04.266 --> 00:20:07.533
Now, Lucario! Mega Evolve!

336
00:20:10.899 --> 00:20:13.800
We’ll finally get to see another Mega Evolution!

337
00:20:13.866 --> 00:20:15.033
I can’t wait!

338
00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:34.666
After overcoming many obstacles

339
00:20:34.733 --> 00:20:37.333
and winning a hard-fought battle against Blaziken,

340
00:20:37.399 --> 00:20:40.133
Korrina has finally obtained the Lucarionite.

341
00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:43.333
Soon, Lucario’s Mega Evolution will be revealed,

342
00:20:43.399 --> 00:20:45.700
as the journey continues!
